Tree mode: comparisons
use complete files
before and after each
commit.

═══════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark edits made
by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one
number is an edit both
patches make: a new
number means both add
it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│du┃ old new│du
        │o ┃        │o
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ a┃        │ a
   1    │a ┃   1    │a
   2   1│b ┃-  2    │b

═══════════════════════
*  CONTEXT DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark lines
present in only one
result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│du┃     new│du
        │o ┃        │o
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ b┃        │
-      1│b ┃        │
